  "releaseNotes": "feat(auth): redesign session middleware identity flow and fix singleton initialization\n\n      - Refactor SessionMiddleware to authenticate through token-based identity mapping\n      - Decouple authentication state from SessionTransport lifecycle\n      - Support flexible unmanaged token identifiers instead of fixed user/session binding\n      - Enforce token uniqueness and maintain identity relationship consistency\n      - Improve authorization flow with group-based permission validation\n\n      - Fix duplicate singleton initialization paths in core runtime\n      - Ensure singleton resources are created before dependent components access them\n      - Clarify separation between lazy singleton access and initialized singleton instances\n\n      - Implement IEquatable<ByteString> and GetHashCode override\n      - Add cached hash-based equality comparison for ByteString\n      - Fix HashSet/Dictionary lookup issues caused by missing value equality semantics",
